{"id":178857171,"slug":"today-finally-deep-tms-is-an-fda","title":"Today, Finally, Deep TMS is an FDA-Cleared Treatment for Adolescent Depression!","subtitle":"This one will be short.","post_date":"2025-11-14T04:25:53.907Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/today-finally-deep-tms-is-an-fda","wordcount":255,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:45:51.690Z","body_sha256":"df041d6a35e12ab227df125214ec936aa5478599973e5a60c529ebd57eb7c02d","text_words":252,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>The Frontier Psychiatrists editorial board—which is just me, Owen Muir—has been of the opinion of that brain simulation is likely an appropriate <a href=\"https://www.meetradial.com/blog/teen-depression-treatment\">treatment for adolescent depression</a>, but before the FDA offer clearance on a new treatment label, it needs data.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!301U!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4597699-f67c-44cf-a0b6-3e49c1a1c0f2_267x200.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!301U!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4597699-f67c-44cf-a0b6-3e49c1a1c0f2_267x200.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!301U!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4597699-f67c-44cf-a0b6-3e49c1a1c0f2_267x200.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!301U!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4597699-f67c-44cf-a0b6-3e49c1a1c0f2_267x200.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!301U!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4597699-f67c-44cf-a0b6-3e49c1a1c0f2_267x200.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!301U!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4597699-f67c-44cf-a0b6-3e49c1a1c0f2_267x200.jpeg\" width=\"267\" height=\"200\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c4597699-f67c-44cf-a0b6-3e49c1a1c0f2_267x200.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:200,&quot;width&quot;:267,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:39179,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/i/178857171?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4597699-f67c-44cf-a0b6-3e49c1a1c0f2_267x200.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!301U!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4597699-f67c-44cf-a0b6-3e49c1a1c0f2_267x200.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!301U!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4597699-f67c-44cf-a0b6-3e49c1a1c0f2_267x200.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!301U!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4597699-f67c-44cf-a0b6-3e49c1a1c0f2_267x200.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!301U!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4597699-f67c-44cf-a0b6-3e49c1a1c0f2_267x200.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Tonight, I want to extend my personal thanks to all the patients we took a chance to get deep TMS, often paying out of pocket, prior to the FDA label announced today.</p><p>Just about a year ago, our friends at Neuronetics (Hi Eli!) got the first adolescent depression TMS label over the line with regulators, and today, the <a href=\"https://www.empr.com/news/brainsway-deep-tms-gains-fda-clearance-for-adolescent-depression/\">Brainsway H1 coil</a> joins those figure of 8 coils as FDA-cleared first line depression treatments!</p><p>This is a great day for youth, and it's all thanks to the kids and families who have a chance before the evidence was completely there.  </p><p>Thank you for working with your doctors, thank you for filling out those rating scales.  Now, more kids will get more effective treatment for their depression.  </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/today-finally-deep-tms-is-an-fda?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/today-finally-deep-tms-is-an-fda?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><p></p><p>As someone has been publishing on this topic since forever…</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gEhP!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa17ad3e7-a2d1-4244-9e44-5b1e53af951d_1320x1216.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gEhP!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa17ad3e7-a2d1-4244-9e44-5b1e53af951d_1320x1216.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gEhP!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa17ad3e7-a2d1-4244-9e44-5b1e53af951d_1320x1216.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gEhP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa17ad3e7-a2d1-4244-9e44-5b1e53af951d_1320x1216.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gEhP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa17ad3e7-a2d1-4244-9e44-5b1e53af951d_1320x1216.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gEhP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa17ad3e7-a2d1-4244-9e44-5b1e53af951d_1320x1216.jpeg\" width=\"1320\" height=\"1216\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a17ad3e7-a2d1-4244-9e44-5b1e53af951d_1320x1216.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1216,&quot;width&quot;:1320,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:391939,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;